# 3️⃣ Count Special Characters

### 🎯 Problem
Count special characters in:

```text
Java@123#Code!
```

Special characters are:

```text
@ # !
```

### 💻 Code

```java
package p3;

public class CountSpecialCharacters {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        String str = "Java@123#Code!";
        int count = 0;

        for(int i = 0; i < str.length(); i++) {

            char ch = str.charAt(i);

            if(!(ch >= 'A' && ch <= 'Z' ||
                 ch >= 'a' && ch <= 'z' ||
                 ch >= '0' && ch <= '9')) {

                count++;
            }
        }

        System.out.println("Special Characters Count = " + count);
    }
}
```

### 📤 Output

```text
Special Characters Count = 3
```

### 🧠 Important Logic

A special character is:

> NOT uppercase + NOT lowercase + NOT digit.

Character ranges:

```java
'A' - 'Z'   → Uppercase
'a' - 'z'   → Lowercase
'0' - '9'   → Digit
```

### ⏱ Complexity

- Time: `O(n)`
- Space: `O(1)`

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# 4️⃣ Count Vowels and Consonants

### 🎯 Problem

Given:

```text
Java Programming
```

Count vowels and consonants.

### 💻 Code

```java
package p3;

public class CountVowelsAndConsonants {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        String str = "Java Programming";

        int count = 0;

        for(int i = 0; i < str.length(); i++) {

            char ch = str.charAt(i);

            if(ch == 'a' || ch == 'e' || ch == 'i' ||
               ch == 'o' || ch == 'u') {

                count++;
            }
        }

        int greaterCount = 0;

        for(int i = 0; i < str.length(); i++) {

            char ch = str.charAt(i);

            if(ch != 'a' && ch != 'e' &&
               ch != 'i' && ch != 'o' &&
               ch != 'u' && ch != ' ') {

                greaterCount++;
            }
        }

        System.out.println("Vowels Count = " + count);
        System.out.println("Consonants Count = " + greaterCount);
    }
}
```

### 📤 Output

```text
Vowels Count = 5
Consonants Count = 10
```

### 🧠 Important `||` vs `&&`

To check whether something **is one of several values**:

```java
ch == 'a' || ch == 'e' || ch == 'i'
```

To check whether something is **not any of several values**:

```java
ch != 'a' && ch != 'e' && ch != 'i'
```

### ⏱ Complexity

- Time: `O(n)`
- Space: `O(1)`

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# 5️⃣ Count Words in a String

### 🎯 Problem

Count the number of words in:

```text
Java is very easy
```

### 💻 Code

```java
package p3;

public class CountWords {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        String str = "Java is very easy";
        int count = 0;

        for(int i = 0; i < str.length(); i++) {

            char ch = str.charAt(i);

            if(ch == ' ') {
                count++;
            }
        }

        int words = count + 1;

        System.out.println("Words count = " + words);
    }
}
```

### 📤 Output

```text
Words count = 4
```

### 🧠 Formula

For a simple sentence with single spaces:

```text
Words = Spaces + 1
```

Example:

```text
Java is very easy
    ↑   ↑    ↑

3 spaces

Words = 3 + 1 = 4
```

### ⚠️ Note

This simple method assumes there are no leading/trailing spaces and no multiple consecutive spaces.

### ⏱ Complexity

- Time: `O(n)`
- Space: `O(1)`

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# 6️⃣ Remove Spaces from a String

### 🎯 Problem

Convert:

```text
Java is very easy
```

into:

```text
Javaisveryeasy
```

### 💻 Code

```java
package p3;

public class RemoveSpaces {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        String str = "Java is very easy";
        String result = "";

        for(int i = 0; i < str.length(); i++) {

            char ch = str.charAt(i);

            if(ch != ' ') {
                result = result + ch;
            }
        }

        System.out.println(result);
    }
}
```

### 📤 Output

```text
Javaisveryeasy
```

### 🧠 Important Concept

```java
String result = "";
```

must be declared **before the loop**.

If declared inside the loop, it gets reset during every iteration.

### ⏱ Complexity

- Time: `O(n)`
- Space: `O(n)`

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# 7️⃣ Replace Spaces with Hyphens

### 🎯 Problem

Convert:

```text
Java is very easy
```

into:

```text
Java-is-very-easy
```

### 💻 Code

```java
package p3;

public class RemoveSpacesWith {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        String str = "Java is very easy";
        String result = "";

        for(int i = 0; i < str.length(); i++) {

            char ch = str.charAt(i);

            if(ch == ' ') {
                result = result + "-";
            }
            else {
                result = result + ch;
            }
        }

        System.out.println(result);
    }
}
```

### 📤 Output

```text
Java-is-very-easy
```

### 🧠 Important Pattern

```java
if(condition) {
    // replace
}
else {
    // keep original
}
```

This pattern is useful for many string transformation problems.

### ⏱ Complexity

- Time: `O(n)`
- Space: `O(n)`

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

