# 9️⃣ Find First Occurrence of a Character

### 🎯 Problem

Find the first index of `'g'` in:

```text
programming
```

### 💻 Code

```java
package p3;

public class FirstOccurenceOfCharacter {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        String str = "programming";
        char target = 'g';

        int index = -1;

        for(int i = 0; i < str.length(); i++) {

            char ch = str.charAt(i);

            if(ch == target) {

                index = i;
                break;
            }
        }

        System.out.println(
            "First Occurences = " + target + " = " + index
        );
    }
}
```

### 📤 Output

```text
First Occurences = g = 3
```

### 🧠 Important Concepts

#### `index = -1`

```java
int index = -1;
```

means:

> Character has not been found yet.

#### `break`

```java
break;
```

stops the loop immediately after finding the first occurrence.

### ⏱ Complexity

- Time: `O(n)` worst case
- Space: `O(1)`

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# 🔟 Count Uppercase and Lowercase Letters

### 🎯 Problem

Given:

```text
Java PROGRAMMING
```

Count uppercase and lowercase letters.

Spaces should be ignored.

### 💻 Code

```java
package p3;

public class CountUppercaseAndLowercaseLetters {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        String str = "Java PROGRAMMING";

        int upperCount = 0;
        int lowerCount = 0;

        for(int i = 0; i < str.length(); i++) {

            char ch = str.charAt(i);

            if(ch >= 'A' && ch <= 'Z') {

                upperCount++;

            }
            else if(ch >= 'a' && ch <= 'z') {

                lowerCount++;
            }
        }

        System.out.println(
            "Uppercase Letters = " + upperCount
        );

        System.out.println(
            "Lowercase Letters = " + lowerCount
        );
    }
}
```

### 📤 Output

```text
Uppercase Letters = 11
Lowercase Letters = 3
```

### 🧠 Important Character Ranges

```java
'A' <= ch <= 'Z'
```

→ Uppercase

```java
'a' <= ch <= 'z'
```

→ Lowercase

The space is automatically ignored because it belongs to neither range.

### ⏱ Complexity

- Time: `O(n)`
- Space: `O(1)`

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

